+- Unit: 45 indexed + 28 decimal + 9 sib_scratch + 14 contract (post-restore)
+  + 51 staging — all green.
+- E2E: S13 scratch gate PASS; D64 gate PASS (`movsd (%rbx, %r14, 8)`
+  folded; sum `0x318000000000BB80` agrees with GCC); D64 battery
